</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p><em>Note: in the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">createSymbolicLinkAtPath:withDestinationPath:error:</code> method, the first parameter <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">LinkAtPath</code> is <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">desc</code>, which is the location where the alias is placed. The second parameter <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">DestinationPath</code> is <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">homePath</code>, representing the original path of the local file. Using the file in the project directory here is just for convenience; be careful not to confuse it with the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">copyItem</code> method.</em></p>

